sequenceDiagram
    actor Ops as Participant
    participant K as Kafka
    participant W as Worker container
    participant T as Temporal + persistent history
    participant UI as Temporal UI

    Note over W,T: Existing workflow dispute-case-case-501<br/>WAITING_FOR_APPROVAL with saved 75000-paise proposal
    Ops->>W: docker compose stop worker
    Note over W: Consumer and task executor are stopped
    Ops->>K: Emit the same case-501 event again
    Note over K: Duplicate event remains pending while consumer is stopped
    Ops->>UI: Inspect recorded workflow history
    UI->>T: Read persisted events
    T-->>UI: Recorded proposal and pending workflow
    Note over UI,T: History works without worker<br/>workflow queries need worker
    Ops->>W: docker compose start worker
    W->>T: Resume polling dispute-resolution-queue
    Note over W,T: Replay restores recorded progress<br/>Completed investigation result is reused<br/>Inference does not need to run again
    K->>W: Deliver duplicate event
    W->>T: Start same workflow ID
    T-->>W: WorkflowAlreadyStartedError
    Note over W: Confirm existing workflow<br/>create no new run
    W->>K: Commit duplicate event offset + 1
    Ops->>T: CLI get_status query
    T->>W: Dispatch query
    W-->>T: Same pending proposal and phase
    T-->>Ops: WAITING_FOR_APPROVAL<br/>no settlement result
    Note over Ops,T: Continue with human approval in the resolution sequence

    Note over W,T: Manual reset is a separate recovery path<br/>Completed INVESTIGATION_FAILED run<br/>keeps Workflow ID but gets a new Run ID<br/>Earlier run history remains available
